==Battleground==
*10 [[Those Guys]] spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*10 [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Mooth]]s spawn after 200 seconds<sup>6,000f</sup>, delay 66.67~100 seconds<sup>2,000f~3,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sakura Android (Enemy)|Sakura Android]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 40~53.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,600f</sup>.
**10 [[Mooth]]s spawn, delay 53.33~80 seconds<sup>1,600f~2,400f</sup>.
**3 [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn, delay 66.67~100 seconds<sup>2,000f~3,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage provides a ton of cash so don't be afraid to bring cats high cost/spam cats. Sakura Android has a small amount of DPS so you can chip it with tanky units.

